            "title": "A launch plan built around your goals",
            "paragraph": {
              "text": "Your specialist maps out every step from setup and branding to the first big day, with clear owners, dates and a checklist your whole team can follow along with.",
              "linkPhrases": [],
              "boldPhrases": [
